          "text": "Kisi oro Solomon oyido miyo cowirok awaŋa kodi cowirok ma siem didek i wi migam m'ogeto ri Rwoth. Go bende owaŋo buban ri Rwoth. Ameno Solomon otieko geto Ot pa Were.",
